Fix Apertus tool parsing so leftover <|tools_suffix|> is not HTTP 500.

The autoparser often drops the section closer. The model then emits
<|tools_prefix|>[{"name": args}]<|tools_suffix|> and the PEG leftover
became a 500 ("Stream resume produced no new bytes" in the web UI).

Ignore leftover special-token closers, use section_end when the prefix
was parked on per_call_start, and recover function-as-key JSON into
OpenAI tool_calls.

